    "ludo.gestureHint.zoom" : {
      "comment" : "Shown over the Ludo board the first times the screen opens, until the person zooms or turns the board with two fingers. Pinch means spreading or closing two fingers. Twist means turning two fingers on the screen, as in Maps.",
